{
  "info": {
    "name": "Papaya HatidGo API (Phase 7-8: driver verification + subscriptions)",
    "description": "Play ADMIN until the admin web exists (Phase 14).\n\nOrder: 1) Admin › Log in (saves the token) → 2) Admin › Review queue (saves the first document_id and driver_id) → 3) Admin › Document detail (saves file_id) → View file / Approve / Reject / Request resubmission.\n\nThe Driver folder lets you upload a test document without the phone (log in as driver2@example.test, then pick any JPG/PNG/PDF in the 'files[]' field).\n\nNeeds: php artisan serve running, MySQL (WAMP) green, seeded accounts (password: password). Language: set the collection variable 'lang' to en or fil.\n\nPhase 8 - Subscriptions folder (as driver2): Log in -> Plans (saves plan_id) -> Subscribe (saves subscription_id + checkout_url; open checkout_url in a browser and Pay) -> Check payment (the server asks the gateway) -> Current. Admin > Find subscriptions / Activate by hand = the demo fallback. \"PayMongo webhook (simulated)\" signs a paid event with webhook_secret (must equal PAYMONGO_WEBHOOK_SECRET in .env).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1"
    },
    {
      "key": "lang",
      "value": "fil"
    },
    {
      "key": "admin_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "driver_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "document_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "file_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "driver_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "plan_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "subscription_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "checkout_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "checkout_url",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "webhook_secret",
      "value": "whsk_local_test"
    },
    {
      "key": "amount_centavos",
      "value": "19900"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Admin",
      "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [
          {
            "key": "token",
            "value": "{{admin_token}}",
            "type": "string"
          }
        ]
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Log in (admin@example.test)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('logged in', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "if (body.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('admin_token', body.token); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"login\": \"admin@example.test\",\n  \"password\": \"password\",\n  \"device_name\": \"postman\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Review queue (drivers with documents to review)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const first = pm.response.json().data?.[0];",
                  "if (first) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('driver_id', first.driver_id);",
                  "  if (first.documents_to_review?.length) { pm.collectionVariables.set('document_id', first.documents_to_review[0].id); }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/driver-verifications?status=to_review",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "driver-verifications"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "status",
                  "value": "to_review",
                  "description": "to_review | pending_verification | under_review | verified | rejected | expired"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Document detail",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const file = pm.response.json().data?.files?.[0];",
                  "if (file) { pm.collectionVariables.set('file_id', file.id); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/admin/driver-documents/{{document_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4. View file (photo/PDF)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/admin/driver-documents/{{document_id}}/files/{{file_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5. Approve",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"expires_at\": null\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/admin/driver-documents/{{document_id}}/approve",
            "description": "Optional: \"expires_at\": \"2027-06-30\" to correct the date read on the photo."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "6. Reject (reason required)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"Malabo ang litrato\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/admin/driver-documents/{{document_id}}/reject",
            "description": "Quick reasons (brief § 8): Malabo ang litrato · Expired na · Hindi tugma ang pangalan · Kulang ang pahina · Hindi tugma ang plate number"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "7. Request resubmission (reason required)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"Kulang ang likod ng license\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/admin/driver-documents/{{document_id}}/request-resubmission"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "8. Suspend driver (reason required)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"Reklamo ng pasahero\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/admin/drivers/{{driver_id}}/suspend"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "9. Reactivate driver",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/admin/drivers/{{driver_id}}/reactivate"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "10. Find subscriptions (pending)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('ok', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "if (body.data && body.data.length) { pm.collectionVariables.set('subscription_id', body.data[0].id); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/admin/subscriptions?state=pending"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "11. Activate subscription by hand (reason required)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"Paid in person during the demo; PayMongo unreachable\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/admin/subscriptions/{{subscription_id}}/activate",
            "description": "Demo fallback (phase-0 F.2 guarantee #6). Written to audit_logs with the admin and the reason."
          }
        }
